/* CONFIG_SECTION
 *  CobbleBattleRewards Configuration
 * 
 * Use /cobblebattlerewards gui to edit rewards in-game.
 * Manual edits are supported; keep JSON syntax valid and run /cobblebattlerewards reload.
 * Reward types: 'item' uses a JSON ItemStack string, 'command' runs a server command.
 * Placeholders: %player%, %pokemon%, %level%, %battleType%, %chance%, %coords%, %trigger%, %time%.
 * Version: 2.0.7
 * Last updated: 2026-07-28T21:58:49.441297338
 */
